<title>GERMANY: Schenker founds Estonia, Latvia ventures.</title>
<headline>Schenker founds Estonia, Latvia ventures.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schenker-Rhenus AG said it has expanded its operations in the Baltic States with new subsidiaries in Estonia and Latvia.</p>
<p>Newly-founded Schenker-Kaukokiito Eesti AS has its own freight terminal in the Estonian capital, Tallinn, and handles all customs arrangements, a statement said.</p>
<p>SIA Schenker-Kaukokiito Latvia in Riga has a freight storage terminal and customs warehouse.</p>
<p>The activities of both companies were orientated towards the German, Finnish and Scandinavian markets, Schenker-Rhenus said.</p>
<p>In Lithuania, Schenker is represented by agencies in Vilnius and the port of Klaipeda. --Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom. Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
